    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49960.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "That's right. So there's a really great opinion piece in the New York Times that was eerily published the day before the explosion took place. And it's called we Lebanese thought we could survive anything. We were wrong. And in it, they really comprehensively explain how this horrible tragedy is just the last straw. But let's talk resignations. The Prime Minister and his entire cabinet have now resigned, which hopefully will inspire some other incompetent heads of state to do the same.",
