  {
    "episode_id": 49960,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49960.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "I think we'll get there. Some of them are calling me like, wow, your story is really amazing. So where they might have thought, we don't want her because she's a this or that. And she was supported by this person in that group. Once they heard my story, it's like, oh, wait a minute. This person really has something to say. This person is of substance. This person is not a prop, as I've been called. you know and so I think that when that starts to happen they see that okay maybe we need to broaden our you know broaden you know what we're thinking a little more I think that that will will be the change and I think it will also cause some of our congress members to look at what they're doing in their own communities because some have been there so long to say well you know what let me do a self-check you know and and I can course correct because we're not saying just throw everybody out and at least I'm not personally. I'm just saying let's just take care of our district so if you need to course correct none of us are infallible you know let's just fix it and do better.",
