    "turn_text": "band Smash Mouth performed on Sunday night in South Dakota for a mostly-mask-free crowd at the Sturgis motorcycle rally. The rally was expected to bring in 250,000 people to the small city of Sturgis. The bikers who saw the concert heard Smash Mouth's lead singers say, fuck that COVID shit, and may have also caught performances from Buck, Cherry, and Quiet Riot, but not Willie Nelson, who canceled. So, Giddy, the big question, does this change your enjoyment of Shrek?",
